{"id":"acabado","lemma":"acabado","pos":"adj","rank":844,"glosses":["worn-out","finished","moneyless; out of money; having no (or very little) money; poor"],"ipa":"/akaˈbado/","forms":{"feminine":"acabada","masculinePlural":"acabados","femininePlural":"acabadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-acabado.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Te has acabado este libro?","en":"Are you through with this book?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645646","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"this"},{"g":"book"}]},{"text":"Mi vida está casi acabada.","en":"My life is almost over.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/845607","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"almost"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"my honey, my love"]]},{"text":"Todavía no ha acabado el día.","en":"The day isn't over yet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/556849","words":[{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"day"}]},{"text":"Cuando hayas acabado, vete de aquí.","en":"When you're done, get out of here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/353181","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"beech, beech tree","l":"haya"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Me he acabado el libro.","en":"I've finished reading the book.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/551747","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"book"}]}]}